{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_600_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_600_ap_02_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "d18cf7066b89c919f2a0db519cdb70ef81ba3d7848de0461ac225aa9daf82d9a", "ja": "正解！　ふふっ、そのお返事ができるなら、\n大丈夫そうですね♪", "zh": "答对了！呵呵，能这样回答的话，看来没问题了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_600_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_600_ap_02_2002_102mis", "source_sha256": "55061923ee3be5920640775659ed31934f690bceac15466040f211b7f92ef9ef", "ja": "ほっ……よかった……！", "zh": "呼……太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
