{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_600_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_600_ap_02_2006_102mis", "source_sha256": "01739584bf4d0fde7d6e15368bf2a4d6ad5aacfa9cbaf3c036185d8ec7a974f9", "ja": "わあ、綺麗なメダルですね！\n何かの優勝メダルみたいですけど……？", "zh": "哇，好漂亮的奖牌啊！\n看起来像是某种比赛的优胜奖牌……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_600_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_600_ap_02_2007_p", "source_sha256": "0408c9ea5eb644aad5d86b282287174f0b1bdde7930571426c65024ad6f43e6b", "ja": "……そうですね。どうやって手に入れたのか、\nちょっとわかりませんけど……。", "zh": "……是啊。虽然不太清楚这是怎么得到的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
